OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Grenfell housing chief given
OL,4,Anew council role
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarnet Council said it was legally
OL,7,Fentitled to appoint Johnson and
OL,8,Fbelieved she was well qualified for the
OL,9,Frole. Johnson declined to comment on
OL,10,Fher appointment.
